      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. Let me write an improved, more readable version.Now I'll write the improved test to the working directory.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version replaces cryptic auto-generated variable names (`jacksonInject_Value0`, `boolean0`, `boolean1`) with descriptive ones (`emptyValue`, `valueWithUseInputEnabled`, `actuallyUsesInput`), inlines the unnecessary `Boolean boolean0 = Boolean.TRUE` intermediate variable, and adds a Javadoc comment explaining the intent of the test."
